+- **Dual World Theme Engine**:
+  1. `ancient-codex`: **Ancient Parchment & Codex (Fantasy)** ΓÇö Warm gold/amber filigree, dark parchment gradients, `Cinzel` & `Lora` serif typography, and rustic RPG borders.
