+- **Interactive World Atlas & Dual Sharing Suite**: Added full-screen Leaflet.js cartography canvas (`#view-atlas`, [public/js/atlas-view.js](file:///c:/Users/EthenGreening/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/lore-vault/public/js/atlas-view.js)) with normalized float coordinates (`x_pct`, `y_pct` range 0.0ΓÇô1.0), reticle pin dropping, article linking, DM Canon vs Public Player view toggle with automated `[secret]` text stripping, live web gateway (`GET /view/:shareToken` with OpenGraph social cards), and single-file standalone web bundle exporter (`POST /api/export/atlas/:worldId`).
