+- **Dual-Engine Automated World Cartographer**: Added `POST /api/maps/auto-generate/procedural`, `POST /api/maps/auto-generate/ai`, and `POST /api/maps/:mapId/auto-pin` endpoints in [server.js](file:///c:/Users/EthenGreening/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/lore-vault/server.js). Implemented 2D Force-Directed Layout algorithm to eliminate coordinate pin stacking, Elevation-Biome Pin Snapping (*Harbors* Γ₧ö Coastlines `0.38ΓÇô0.42`, *Peaks/Citadels* Γ₧ö Mountains `>0.70`), Spiral Grid-Collision Allocator, and `Γ£¿ Auto-Generate Map` / `≡ƒôî Auto-Place Pins` buttons in [public/js/atlas-view.js](file:///c:/Users/EthenGreening/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/lore-vault/public/js/atlas-view.js).
